sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant MW as Oauth2UserClient (MW)
    participant R as API Routes<br/>(routes/api.php)
    participant AC as ApiController
    participant FR as FormRequest
    participant P as Policy
    participant S as Service
    participant M as Model
    participant J as Job
    participant AR as ApiResource

    Note over C,AR: Permission Grant Flow
    C->>MW: POST /api/permissions/grant
    MW->>R: authenticated request
    R->>AC: UserPermissionController.grant()
    AC->>FR: GrantUserFeaturePermissionRequest
    FR->>P: UserFeaturePermissionPolicy.create()
    P-->>FR: authorized
    FR-->>AC: validated data
    AC->>S: UserPermissionService.grantPermission()
    S->>M: DB::transaction begin
    S->>M: UserFeaturePermission.create()
    M-->>S: permission model
    S->>M: DB::transaction commit
    S-->>AC: permission
    AC->>AR: UserFeaturePermissionResource
    AR-->>AC: formatted response
    AC-->>C: 201 Created JSON

    Note over C,AR: CSV Upload Flow (SD-OOP_Pocket_expense.pdf)
    C->>MW: POST /api/uploads/pocket-expense/csv (multipart/form-data)
    MW->>R: authenticated request
    R->>AC: PocketExpenseUploadController.uploadPocketExpenseCSV()
    AC->>FR: PocketExpenseCSVUploadRequest
    FR->>FR: validate(file: csv,txt|max:10240, user_id, expense_user_id, client_id)
    FR->>P: PocketExpensePolicy.create()
    P->>P: expense_user_id belongs to client_id
    P->>P: client has OOP feature enabled
    P->>P: user_id can manage expense_user_id
    P-->>FR: authorized
    FR-->>AC: validated file + params

    AC->>M: Store CSV to storage/app/pocket-expense-uploads
    AC->>M: PocketExpenseFileUpload.create(status='uploaded')
    M-->>AC: uploadRecord(id)

    AC->>S: PocketExpenseCSVValidator(targetUserId, clientId, adminId)
    S->>S: loadReferenceData() [expense types, currencies, countries, sources]
    S->>S: validate headers (exact column name match)
    S->>S: validateRow() for each row (max 200)
    S-->>AC: validation result {errors[] or valid_rows[]}

    AC->>M: PocketExpenseFileUpload.update(total_records, valid_records, validation_errors, validated_at)

    alt Validation fails (any row has errors)
        AC->>M: PocketExpenseFileUpload.update(status='validation_failed')
        AC-->>C: 422 {success:false, errors:[{line_number, field, error, value}]}
    else Validation passes (all rows valid)
        AC->>M: DB::table('pocket_expense_uploads_data')->insert(bulk)
        AC->>M: PocketExpenseFileUpload.update(status='processing')
        AC->>J: ProcessExpenseUpload::dispatch(uploadRecord->id)
        AC-->>C: 200 {success:true, upload_id, total_rows}

        J->>S: PocketExpenseService.createExpense() [background]
        S->>M: PocketExpense.create() [batch of 100]
        S->>M: PocketExpenseMetadata.create() [batch]
        S->>M: PocketExpenseFileUpload.update(status='completed', processed_at)
        J->>C: Notification (channel TBD)
    end

    Note over C,AR: Single Expense Creation Flow
    C->>MW: POST /api/pocket-expenses
    MW->>R: authenticated request
    R->>AC: PocketExpenseController.store()
    AC->>FR: StorePocketExpenseRequest
    FR->>P: PocketExpensePolicy.create()
    P-->>FR: authorized
    FR-->>AC: validated data
    AC->>S: PocketExpenseService.createExpenseWithMetadata()
    S->>S: FXConversionService.getFXRate(date, currency, client_id)
    S->>M: DB::transaction begin
    S->>M: PocketExpense.create()
    M-->>S: expense model
    S->>M: PocketExpenseMetadata.create() [multiple]
    S->>M: DB::transaction commit
    S-->>AC: expense with metadata
    AC->>AR: PocketExpenseResource
    AR-->>AC: formatted response
    AC-->>C: 201 Created JSON

    Note over C,AR: Expense List with Permissions
    C->>MW: GET /api/pocket-expenses
    MW->>R: authenticated request
    R->>AC: PocketExpenseController.index()
    AC->>P: PocketExpensePolicy.viewAny()
    P-->>AC: authorized
    AC->>S: PocketExpenseService.getUserExpenses()
    S->>S: UserPermissionService.canManageUser()
    S->>M: PocketExpense.with(['user','metadata','expenseType']).paginate()
    M-->>S: paginated expenses
    S-->>AC: expenses collection
    AC->>AR: PocketExpenseResource::collection()
    AR-->>AC: formatted response
    AC-->>C: 200 OK JSON